    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1486">

                <pb facs="1197" n="1081" xml:id="pg1081"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/273.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">
                        Brown Brothers and Company and J. and W. Seligman and
                            Company to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-12-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 13, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: We have the honor of handing you herewith,
                    for your information, copy of a contract entered into on December 9th between
                    the Republic of Nicaragua, the Ethelburga Syndicate, Limited, of London, and
                    such holders of Nicaraguan Government bonds of the issue of 1909 as may
                    hereafter assent thereto.</p>
                <p>This contract was negotiated by us on behalf of Nicaragua in accordance with the
                    terms of the agreement of September 1, 1911, between the Republic of Nicaragua
                    and ourselves, copy of which accompanied our letter to you of November 2nd last.
                    By its terms the contract of December 9th is subject to the approval of the
                    Nicaraguan Executive, to whom we have submitted it.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brown Brothers and Company</hi>. <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. and W. Seligman and Company.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
